From: fxtec-pro1x-guix
Subject: [PATCH] With $PRO1X_OSK_MANUAL, complete in any normal text field

Completion waits for the application's completion hint, or the button in the
layout menu.  Firefox-based browsers do not seem to send the hint, so the bar
never showed there (author, 2026-11-03).  In Sway, the completion mode alone
decides: on unless it is empty.  Only "normal" text input still completes, so
not passwords or URL bars.  Phosh and the greeter run without the variable.
---
--- a/src/pos-input-surface.c
+++ b/src/pos-input-surface.c
@@ -2435,7 +2435,8 @@
       return TRUE;
   }
 
-  if (self->completion_enabled == FALSE)
+  if (self->completion_enabled == FALSE &&
+      !(g_getenv ("PRO1X_OSK_MANUAL") && self->completion_mode != PHOSH_OSK_COMPLETION_MODE_NONE))
     return FALSE;
 
   /* Completion should only be used on "regular" layouts */
